cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  Participation Is Not Collaboration: Tracing Public Ownership After
  Cross-Product Agent Review
message: >-
  If you use this artifact, please cite the accompanying paper. Author
  affiliations and the archival DOI are pending and will be filled in at
  submission.
type: software
authors:
